  "new_claims": [
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "章首一个声音惊问「唐僧死了，谁干的？」；该声音的来源在章内未指明。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "唐僧死了，谁干的？"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "孙悟空因这句问话从梦里醒来，头还有些痛，一时忘了自己是谁、现在身处何处。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "孙悟空于是从梦里醒了过来"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "孙悟空重新想起自己叫孙悟空，正躺在路上的某间民舍的墙角草堆里。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "正躺在路上的某间民舍的墙角草堆里"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "草屋中酒碗碰撞、喧闹声不断，猪八戒满脸通红地喊着「再来一碗！」，把碗里的酒和饭混在一起稀里呼噜喝下去，不顾旁边村民正看着他。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "满脸通红的猪八戒喊着"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "孙悟空走到屋外，站在天井中，向篱笆外的一片夜色望着。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "站在屋外的天井中"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "唐僧从屋里走出来，笑着向屋里人扬手，转头看见孙悟空后与他搭话；孙悟空也向唐僧搭话，就夜色、天亮与自己是否也喝酒发问。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "唐僧从屋里走了出来"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "唐僧对孙悟空说「一片漆黑能看见些什么呢？」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "一片漆黑能看见些什么呢"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-8",
      "text": "孙悟空对唐僧说「睁着眼也是黑，闭着眼也是黑，我可不可以站在这儿等天亮？」，并反问唐僧「你居然也喝酒么？」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我可不可以站在这儿等天亮"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-9",
      "text": "唐僧自称「我是出家人，出家人不能喝酒，只喝水」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "出家人不能喝酒，只喝水"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-10",
      "text": "孙悟空质疑猪八戒喝了二十碗也全是水；唐僧回答「他既然只求一醉，又有什么不可以呢？」，随即多次把空碗凑到嘴边装做一饮而尽，并呷着空碗说「啊，好酒」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "他既然只求一醉"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-11",
      "text": "猪八戒所饮之物是否为酒在章内存在两种表述：叙述写他碗里「酒和饭混在一起」，唐僧则称他喝的水也能「只求一醉」，本章未给出定论。",
      "certainty": "uncertain",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "碗里酒和饭混在一起"
        },
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "那猪八戒干了二十碗也全是水"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-12",
      "text": "唐僧说沙僧「一看见碗啊杯子之类的手就发抖，杯子也端不起来」，并说这次沙僧吃饭的竹筒丢了，明天要去再弄一段。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "一看见碗啊杯子之类的手就发抖"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-13",
      "text": "屋里传来瓷碗摔碎的声音，沙僧一声惨叫；猪八戒狂笑道「碎了，这声音好听！破了，破成一片、一片、一片一片一片……」；沙僧抱着头在屋里地上打起滚来。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "沙僧抱着头在屋里地上打起滚来"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-14",
      "text": "孙悟空冷冷地问「又发作了吗？」，随后问唐僧「我头痛发作的时候，样子是不是比他还难看？」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000056.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000056",
          "chapter_order": 56,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "又发作了吗"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-15",
      "text": "唐僧回答孙悟空说「我总在想，什么东西可以把人变成那个样子」，并称「他们不能用那种痛苦来挟制我，因为……我没那样的欲望」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 56,
      "source_refs": [
